      "measured, the two-systems claim as the user's own verdict rather than a log inference: the probe's docs/CHECKLIST.md marked item 2 (ownership) as the ONE question only the player could answer, because ownership had not settled inside the tick the log covered. The user's confirmation closes it, and it is recorded as such in <mods>/zz_probe_longroad/REPORT.md section 8 and <clone>/unga-fix/longroad-origin-notes.md."
